kmap 1
id brai-right_hand_invert
layout brai
variant right_hand_invert
name Braille (one-handed, right, inverted thumb)
key BKSL \ |
key AC07 braille_dot_1
key AC08 braille_dot_4
key AC09 braille_dot_6
key AC10 braille_dot_5
key LSGT < > | ¦
key AB05 braille_dot_2
key AB06 braille_dot_3
key SPCE space
key KPDL KP_Delete KP_Decimal
key KP4 braille_dot_1 KP_4
key KP5 braille_dot_4 KP_5
key KP6 braille_dot_5 KP_6
key KPAD braille_dot_6 KP_Add KP_Add KP_Add XF86Next_VMode type=CTRL+ALT
key KP1 braille_dot_2 KP_1
key KP0 braille_dot_3 KP_0
